dition_Icon.webp/60px-Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disengage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disengage_(Condition)\" title=\"Disengage (Condition)\">Disengage</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Can move without provoking <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack of Opportunity\">Opportunity Attacks</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_items\">Related items</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume\" title=\"Cloak of Cunning Brume\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Cloak_of_Cunni